msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B85E47A8_2A5C_4EAB_B10B_A58D1633E893"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫Slowly but surely, time trekked onward, everyone working toward their own individual goals."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫여러 마음과 함께 ⟪k:35⟫시간은 천천히, ⟪k:36⟫꾸준히 흘러갔습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_D2036877_CB64_4A97_8B0F_4D65C53B3156
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2fe609242663abb5b3b5adbea7b19f7a4409c784430dc8621bd65e35fba9d03f
#. default-sha256: 936b0b7d77e8cb9b9732e787ae69481b016d290cfae23c3dd98643bb111d3bcd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D2036877_CB64_4A97_8B0F_4D65C53B3156"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Each early-summer breeze that blew through the garden was like God’s hallowed breath "
"carrying the flowers’ fragrance in through Rose Manor’s windows."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫초여름의 싱그러운 바람이 정원에 불자, ⟪k:1⟫창문을 통해 달콤한 향기가 들어왔습니다. ⟪k:2⟫장미 "
"저택을 축복하는 ⟪k:3⟫신의 숨결처럼요."

#: scenario:scenario_9A4DE7BB_0C12_411E_AE8C_2E488320BDE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9babfffa2344005f3fc94a5ca1d14c23e752f553fb034bd4add112d42167f89a
#. default-sha256: 7d52563bb96161edfac35b98d3048002c7f32c95b18220fd96d21a97b2bc7d8d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9A4DE7BB_0C12_411E_AE8C_2E488320BDE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If only time could be stopped, and this beautiful era made to live on through eternity."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이대로 시간이 멈추면 ⟪k:1⟫영원히 아름다운 시대가 이어지겠지요……."

#: scenario:scenario_C8801846_7252_4B91_84FD_916BE74A68A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7c4137646eb7a4ce84cb63c85794eb9c2786e30cc573bfe515e47cbd9457e64
#. default-sha256: 3ee3ef762e388b2a7595765a9d9f517ab106aafbfadcde3d91b50efb0346ba95
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C8801846_7252_4B91_84FD_916BE74A68A7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As usual, Mell’s eyes chased after the White-Haired Girl, and Nellie pursed her lips in "
"frustration at him. ⟪k:1⟫But she was still rather docile."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫멜의 시선은 여전히 백발 소녀를 찾아다녔으며, ⟪k:1⟫넬리는 그런 오빠가 불만스러웠습니다. ⟪k:2⟫"
"그래도 ⟪k:3⟫귀여울 따름이었지요."

#: scenario:scenario_413EE96A_C6D7_4B31_8421_5DE9B5B6592E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c760f5bc51dc3a5aa1c43f96f26d650199f5987591251daca894c5283e1eb74a
#. default-sha256: d7666ff554dd89085fbf01ebbd90752cbc21b0a7001ca57a51e228f67ad786b3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_413EE96A_C6D7_4B31_8421_5DE9B5B6592E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Even taking into account how self-centered she behaved, how fickle her temper, Nellie’s fits "
"were still no worse than a playful kitten."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫넬리의 어리광과 ⟪k:1⟫행실은 ⟪k:2⟫그 안에 성난 마음이 담겨 있더라도, ⟪k:3⟫아직 새끼고양이가 재"
"롱을 부리는 수준이었거든요."

#: scenario:scenario_5D308507_DC8D_4784_9099_C7E5E1924E30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2dd130026509a8b26b32771dbc562b746e341621fa29611479768752e6fa057
#. default-sha256: cf56ef53677d4d6767028257e243d6cc7089bec8157140ac55bd4fc8437cacbd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5D308507_DC8D_4784_9099_C7E5E1924E30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫See? At that very moment, our lively little feline had her claws poised to swat at the "
"flaxen-haired young man."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫자, ⟪k:1⟫바로 지금, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫말괄량이 새끼고양이가 아마빛 청년을 할퀴려 하는군요……."

#: scenario:scenario_FD95A642_51F8_40B0_8FBA_93F6CCA6FA16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ccc99d0487432360f06e47659b5e3ba8a9443a646ec945a882e369614cb78343
#. default-sha256: 82e7c1e6f1a3ab4672e5de0ef07862ff70096ee18d639d246077f8661e293f71
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_FD95A642_51F8_40B0_8FBA_93F6CCA6FA16"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hehehe."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫우후후……."

#: scenario:scenario_DBE9B976_12DB_4DBB_8E83_7FC83F259946
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6ef2e8710ef741c240f528c9ed749967b984bb447b7f7fe2dfa06effe35552a
#. default-sha256: 5d66da6609eaafc23a79ae1d261a77cc21b7ed8a4ddac1752c934f2b9f5bc69d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_DBE9B976_12DB_4DBB_8E83_7FC83F259946"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Mell!⟪k:9⟫You promised me!⟪k:10⟫Or have you "
"forgotten?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫오라버니! ⟪k:9⟫넬리랑 약속한 건 어쨌어!? ⟪k:10⟫까먹었"
"어!?"

#: scenario:scenario_DD3F9AE7_91E2_400A_8840_9D8ED4C66C53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: efb6e782a2c4319863dc008a25f37cc5396d3a2ffa00a19009d1162774ea1221
#. default-sha256: 9a6d4ec071c08ab8432b875511d7f920ac60820deb7a532b7efccfc8989adb86
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_DD3F9AE7_91E2_400A_8840_9D8ED4C66C53"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I haven’t forgotten, I’m just asking if we can go another day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫안 까먹었어……,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫다른 날에 가자고 했잖아."

#: scenario:scenario_DB64EEF5_3153_4721_80BE_6A8D3C452F51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b24aa2d0532df7d70ff866edc9e8535fe3aade8a68b8cd0eb11a8373f4dab025
#. default-sha256: a2e5acf704bc029cd0f3902ecab842ab327219e0965416ab69f9b6323f25102f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_DB64EEF5_3153_4721_80BE_6A8D3C452F51"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Another day?⟪k:3⟫ This isn’t something that happens every day!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I’ve been "
"looking forward to tonight’s performance for so long."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫다른 날이라니, ⟪k:2⟫아무 때나 볼 수 있는 게 아니란 말이야! ⟪k:3⟫오늘 공연을 ⟪k:4⟫넬리가 "
"얼마나 기대했는데……."

#: scenario:scenario_64CBF9EE_F404_48E3_BA36_662BC330EF22
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 09a7ba8fd467223f507b614d7028b70bbfd8b17fab76b3c5d7809b60b64f40e3
#. default-sha256: 6a39a9cfee7cc89e7817adbf8d176a50e341fdf20da2fe11e0ae184aa8fddc28
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_64CBF9EE_F404_48E3_BA36_662BC330EF22"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There’s nothing I can do about that. We’re having a gathering at the priest’s home "
"tonight. ⟪k:2⟫Several high-ranking officials have come up from the mainland just for this."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫뭘 어쩌겠어. ⟪k:2⟫오늘 밤은 신부님 댁에 모이기로 했거든. ⟪k:3⟫대륙의 높으신 분께서 ⟪k:4⟫"
"와 계시는데……."

#: scenario:scenario_A4ED2DE1_002E_4D59_91D2_FDE757FC6D54
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dcb5be5d2606f93304286e10e836c63b2f4ae4a477c7ff295ecf8431cd91221f
#. default-sha256: 366577eccf63974b3114172c9996a40af4df011db9c1f16bc1f59708005c851e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A4ED2DE1_002E_4D59_91D2_FDE757FC6D54"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Who cares?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그런 건 아무래도 좋아!"

#: scenario:scenario_2ECAF814_92B5_4FCA_9A2C_BA4FE44F2586
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bea972b89b978dbd21e326b8c6f918decd8de25ae811bd23dc5766f0d3b225e1
#. default-sha256: 987903d0cf54ff5bacec02ea45996c563814b10204333585195c791b477ed2e2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2ECAF814_92B5_4FCA_9A2C_BA4FE44F2586"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I-⟪k:2⟫I care...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You know, Nellie... ⟪k:5⟫it doesn’t ⟪k:6⟫have⟪k:7⟫ to be me "
"who goes with you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫아, ⟪k:2⟫아무래도 좋다니……. ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫저기 있지, ⟪k:5⟫넬리……, ⟪k:6⟫굳이 ⟪k:7⟫내가 같이 "
"안 가도 되잖아."

#: scenario:scenario_01CE9B15_4BDF_445A_B799_9227D376C28C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61e64dc8ab0c7065b7001bbdd7d0360f965f0e0a25f7d5ea5b7f9b3af7d712ee
#. default-sha256: 162d6cdec0a64cdcdff23bd829adfa45931ee0b89aa25df5f550509fa46dc70f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_01CE9B15_4BDF_445A_B799_9227D376C28C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No! I want to go with you, Mell!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫싫어! ⟪k:2⟫오라버니랑 같이 갈래."

#: scenario:scenario_C8F83018_7993_4DEB_87D4_A32FD1F60C4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e20e25b1a2c5f7b72e9b5314ce5317d66f5d5e279f8844195ac5acc0a3fdde6d
#. default-sha256: 252dadbe63cd8590e2736f93a7d3d0321dbd4d7acda59834c5f585a314d3d143
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C8F83018_7993_4DEB_87D4_A32FD1F60C4A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You’ve been so distant lately, dearest Mell.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You refuse to do anything with "
"me..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫오라버니는 ⟪k:2⟫요즘 ⟪k:3⟫넬리한테 쌀쌀맞아. ⟪k:4⟫상대해 주질 않아……."

#: scenario:scenario_1B36894A_FFC7_4F9A_B2F9_50D0F1E37722
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d31f51284d5278a9f3f9c445364e4e7cc6afbc112027711e5b20d329eb9a537
#. default-sha256: 25e96e03ec39a928b01550b0092df858e7edb98d7582173fea3171926cffa66b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1B36894A_FFC7_4F9A_B2F9_50D0F1E37722"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That’s not true."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫안 그래……."

#: scenario:scenario_0B4E29E2_F75F_4C33_B0C7_FB7A63F16B56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 73bddeb00e7906d08fa11617b56b47bf4fc65a41d3c7dda430fcba63977f6c94
#. default-sha256: 0c8331802977f26807401fdd0214e6ede11244d902ec0a52d41c549f811231a3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0B4E29E2_F75F_4C33_B0C7_FB7A63F16B56"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tell me—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫if you can’t go today, when ⟪k:4⟫can⟪k:5⟫ you?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫When will you "
"be willing to go out with me?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫저기, ⟪k:2⟫오늘이 안 되면 언제 되는데? ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫언제가 되면 같이 나가 줄 건데?"

#: scenario:scenario_4C33E21F_95D7_4D67_A60C_4A7B5FA336B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0eb9d065a22ee1711f3e7c8ca292395df1d2993da21a904064b823714913833e
#. default-sha256: 4e05f3d59e8801ce1fcb40bad17eb6137a8c9bf3a27a1b17d882f9ec8d0fda9f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4C33E21F_95D7_4D67_A60C_4A7B5FA336B8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫When will you be willing to play cards with me?⟪k:1⟫To have tea together?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫언제 ⟪k:1⟫같이 카드 게임을 하거나 ⟪k:2⟫차를 마실래?"

#: scenario:scenario_9385E4E7_E567_4872_B6EA_244B62C0B2D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f0fd22e1b9b48277c56a869e568755c760dbb3bbead36a7607fe0cb2fe318fc
#. default-sha256: b4070e8ef1029905a8e8f0e2c5d071bd0928573ceff1df23e034d4d2591f49c5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9385E4E7_E567_4872_B6EA_244B62C0B2D2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I... ⟪k:2⟫can’t make any promises.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I have things to do—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫obligations."
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫And Nellie, you’re almost an adult yourself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그건…… 약속 못 하지. ⟪k:2⟫나도 할 게 많이 있는데……. ⟪k:3⟫넬리, ⟪k:4⟫너도 ⟪k:5⟫이제 어른"
"이 될 거 아니야."

#: scenario:scenario_A39F153A_73C7_459B_B747_63D03965ADA6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33553ccf8ddda5c40314af6e444219c8fa4e4fdc2b0c9f18ba0590306dc20b71
#. default-sha256: 96f558df5ee758ce64d71f6200ee5011ad34e104039347cfe941b1a6e1781f44
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A39F153A_73C7_459B_B747_63D03965ADA6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Stop acting like such a child."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫애 같은 소리는 그만해."

#: scenario:scenario_353CAC4C_8617_486B_855D_4297A1FFF2F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08f1401dce75ec4a09e8f583f6e65c8be001cb0365afece65d80eeb61121fdaf
#. default-sha256: c1d1a7d37da869a06d87070261e3cbcdd3c7d23073c5bab52a19b3d0d2a58e92
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_353CAC4C_8617_486B_855D_4297A1FFF2F9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’m not an adult yet!⟪k:2⟫I’m still a kid!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫넬리는 어른 아니야, ⟪k:2⟫아직 애야!"

#: scenario:scenario_37C57A29_53DC_4562_B66A_6A46209983BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 899c708c31bd22ed4366ee4750a0a9fccb61ad003b88cf632a4ad214abc3661a
#. default-sha256: 5abb3261a03f24272d672e28c6912e5315131dbf5037c66597193609d7a5fe50
